<title>FRANCE: Estimated breakdown of French EU grain bids.</title>
<headline>Estimated breakdown of French EU grain bids.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-10-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Grain traders gave the following estimated, cumulative breakdown of bids for free-market wheat and barley through France at Thursday's weekly European tender.</p>
<p>		 -- WHEAT --</p>
<p>  Cumulative volume     Maximum refund</p>
<p>    (tonnes)		 (Ecus/tonne)</p>
<p>    26,000		    16.95</p>
<p>   215,000		    19.98</p>
<p>   520,000		    22.00</p>
<p>   586,300		    27.47</p>
<p>		-- BARLEY --</p>
<p>    50,000		    34.77</p>
<p>   102,000		    36.00</p>
<p>   332,000		    42.85</p>
<p>-- Paris newsroom +331 4221 5432</p>
